#: tips.cpp:3
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"<table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"10\" align=\"center\">\n"
"<tr>\n"
"<td>\n"
"<img src=\"hicolor/32x32/apps/digikamimageplugins.png\">\n"
"</td>\n"
"<td>\n"
"Did you know that you can keep a zone clear of raindrops with the\n"
"'Select' tool? Selecting the area to avoid (for example a face) before\n"
"launching the 'RainDrops' filter will keep it free from rain drops.\n"
"</td>\n"
"</tr>\n"
"</table>\n"
"</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"<table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"10\" align=\"center\">\n"
"<tr>\n"
"<td>\n"
"<img src=\"hicolor/32x32/apps/digikamimageplugins.png\">\n"
"</td>\n"
"<td>\n"
"'चयन गर्नुहोस्' उपकरण प्रयोग गरेर तपाईँले रेनड्रप क्षेत्रलाई खाली राख्न सक्नुहुन्छ भन्ने \n"
"तपाईँलाई थाहा थियो ? 'रेनड्रप' फिल्टर थालनी गर्नुपूर्व क्षेत्र उपेक्षा गर्न चयन गर्नुभयो भने (उदाहरणका लागि फेस) \n"
"यसले रेनड्रपबाट स्वतन्त्र गराउछ ।\n"
"</td>\n"
"</tr>\n"
"</table>\n"
"</p>\n"

#: tips.cpp:21
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"<table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"10\" align=\"center\">\n"
"<tr>\n"
"<td>\n"
"<img src=\"hicolor/32x32/apps/digikamimageplugins.png\">\n"
"</td>\n"
"<td>\n"
"Did you know that you can simulate the graininess of black-and-white photos "
"with the 'FilmGrain' image editor plugin.\n"
"</td>\n"
"</tr>\n"
"</table>\n"
"</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>\n"
"<table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"10\" align=\"center\">\n"
"<tr>\n"
"<td>\n"
"<img src=\"hicolor/32x32/apps/digikamimageplugins.png\">\n"
"</td>\n"
"<td>\n"
"तपाईँले 'फिल्मग्रेन' छवि सम्पादक प्लगइनसँग श्यामश्वेत फोटोको ग्रेननेस नक्कल गर्न सक्नुहुन्छ भन्ने तपाईँलाई थाहा थियो ।\n"
"</td>\n"
"</tr>\n"
"</table>\n"
"</p>\n"

